Package: aether
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: pengtang1024 <pengtang1024@qq.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= @LIBC@), libfontconfig1, libfreetype6, libxkbcommon0, libwayland-client0, libwayland-cursor0, libwayland-egl1, libx11-6, libx11-xcb1, libxcb1, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libgl1, libegl1, hicolor-icon-theme, desktop-file-utils
Recommends: fonts-noto-cjk
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/pengtang1024/Aether
Description: Native Material 3 download manager mockup
 Aether is a native desktop download manager UI mockup built with Rust and
 Slint. It uses Slint's Material 3 widget set and contains no WebView,
 networking or persistence.
